{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "ca7053553026d1fb4a92aa816e3854668c187fad2ca4e1a4a06703082ad5eac2", "ja": "私のこと、不安にさせないでね？", "zh": "可别让我感到不安哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1b1748c9f4ac858526215a5e16109f6eca370815fe7404d84aa56af91e59bd81", "ja": "特訓を始めたメンバー達だったが、ヤンデレ\nをテーマにした歌の解釈で悩む。昴の話を\nきっかけにして、今の状況が結構ヤンデレ\nなのでは？と気づく一同。今のままで\nいけるはず！と、自信を取り戻すのだった。", "zh": "开始特训的成员们，却为如何诠释以病娇为主题的歌曲而烦恼。以昴的话为契机，大家意识到现在的状况其实已经相当病娇了？就这样想着“保持现在这样应该就能行！”重新找回了自信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "b990df91ce8558bb066582087ef6ac528afb6bbe617735514136e56d92cd83f9", "ja": "振りつけや歌詞はもう頭に入ってるけど……\nヤンデレへの理解は、まだちょっと難しいかも。", "zh": "舞蹈动作和歌词已经记在脑海里了，但是……\n要理解病娇，可能还是有点难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "300ae416346176d2d425cb43c45b5e3ea42ed7538bf5b980f3a22247fa2507da", "ja": "好きすぎて病んじゃう、ってやつだよね？\n亜美、そういう経験はないからな～。", "zh": "就是喜欢到病态的那种，对吧？\n亚美可没有那种经历呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "3ba121210ce10eafdddf01ed9aeb363f37086184bff31fe2aa660abe643c5d94", "ja": "そういえば……オレ、家でヤンデレのこと\nいろいろ調べててさ。兄ちゃんたちにも聞いたんだよ。", "zh": "说起来……我在家里查了好多关于病娇的事。还问了哥哥们呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "a23c9f2db85dfe8219fd44f25dc98e56a332bf9c10e48f2646422e090a78601f", "ja": "そしたら、「昴には早い」とか「似合わない」とか……\nあーっ、思い出したらまた腹立ってきた！", "zh": "结果他们却说什么“昴还太早了”，还有“也不适合你”之类的……\n啊——一想起来我又来气了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "c1ad148d940f496b26faf8c46806ae2bd5248eedd2e59507a7d96a898f6d3bbb", "ja": "ふふっ。昴さんはお兄さまたちと、仲良しなんですね！\nすこし、うらやましいです。", "zh": "呵呵。昴小姐和哥哥们关系很好呢！\n我有点羡慕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "d439f5cd89f4a346730b8a904173d414f67b7b0582886017a945b6620c8a8436", "ja": "どこが～！？　兄ちゃんたちなんて、\nオレのこと子ども扱いしてばっかでさ……。", "zh": "哪里像啦～！？哥哥们老是把我当小孩子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "864b792d3a915c531fdf846435df7eb2661778e8a67ab8a0f46a6200ac355db5", "ja": "あ……そっか。\nエミリー、ひとりっ子だっけ？", "zh": "啊……这样啊。\n艾米莉是独生女吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "f151cbae2b4dd77972b7b660b8a85ecf05edf41ba629b042e0e793788a9d22c2", "ja": "はい。私には体験できないことですから……\n大変そうですけど、やっぱりうらやましいです。", "zh": "是的。因为这是我无法体验的事情……虽然看起来很辛苦，但我还是很羡慕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "df489694f543cf2c093a16519afff50abd34d87fb73a2a1103956ab5ed2a0039", "ja": "あ！　ですが、昴さんがとても魅力的な\n大和撫子であることは、間違いありません！", "zh": "啊！不过，昴小姐是一位极富魅力的大和抚子，\n这一点是毫无疑问的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "22da2718d137084e10820f0f48782ecdd93ce624513aa3f51820b1aa377cfbbd", "ja": "なので、今度お兄さまたちがそう仰ったら、\n私が昴さんのお味方をさせていただきます！", "zh": "所以，下次哥哥们再这么说的话，就由我来站在昴小姐这边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "4eda6f8f565dff151e558cc77f4c5b82c32c06edd5165da0e20c7a220810e4c1", "ja": "エミリー……うん！　ありがとな♪", "zh": "艾米莉……嗯！谢谢你啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "86e61fdd8ed503157338c236d8f0b8505d910f9e61f82650d0e4e381f0a49413", "ja": "けど、自分でもよくわかんないんだけど……。\n昨日はオレ、なんかすっげー不安になっちゃってさ。", "zh": "可是，我自己也搞不太懂……  \n昨天我不知怎么的，突然变得特别不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "1e8a9a21d5c6184c357ed903953f2ee4f07ba092ebd2732080652fe79b6c056d", "ja": "{$P$}も兄ちゃんたちも、絶対\nオレたちのほうがカワイイって言うと思ってたから。", "zh": "我本来以为，{$P$}和哥哥他们\n绝对会说我们这边更可爱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "4c0a9afdaf50785c56761f1126c30344fa9d03bea2999a01ff4b7da1447f9def", "ja": "そんなの、不安になって当たり前だよ昴くん！\nだって昴くんの兄ちゃんは、昴くんのきょうだいだし！", "zh": "这种事会让人感到不安也是理所当然的啦，昴！毕竟昴的哥哥可是昴的亲兄弟嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "7f766e991ab30f9c28177e4a6e689dff2cc40a769dff2c1c4665393645fa738f", "ja": "それとおんなじで、亜美たちの兄ちゃんは\n亜美たちのプロデューサーじゃん！　なのに……！", "zh": "同样的道理，亜美她们的哥哥不就是亜美她们的制作人嘛！可是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "7a462404976c1ab0970eb97f6865c9b1ec477671c18b3d0328525121f086d299", "ja": "そうですね。私も、仕掛け人さまをあの方々に\n取られてしまったように感じて……もやもやと……。", "zh": "是啊。我也觉得，制作人先生好像被那些人抢走了……心里总觉得闷闷的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "68210611564929f8dc1ec47674a420ff4d1bf39efee822389059e5af839aa5c3", "ja": "亜美も！　だから、「絶対ダメー！！！」って、\n思わず兄ちゃんを引っ張っちった。", "zh": "亚美也是！所以就不由得想着“绝对不行——！！！”然后把哥哥拉过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "273b1a0abffa655749f5f802ee59e8c65fbfac37eb0d390ea4c550de4e07c0f1", "ja": "……。もしかして……。", "zh": "……难道……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "48da75432858bce9d6a41886c4a660b95eaeb6c1f0096ebe3ef40026f42b2044", "ja": "あの時、みんなが感じていた気持ちって……\nすこしだけ、ヤンデレに近いんじゃない？", "zh": "那时候，大家所感受到的心情……\n是不是稍微有点接近病娇？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "6c9ae0c4523568fc89a07edcac457c6cf7017ad45bf166195c57060e2a861f4e", "ja": "えっ。そ、そうなのか？　志保。", "zh": "诶……是、是这样吗？志保。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "1e5fa2d64fa12b1c2688ebc9d020bbfbda3ba3bdd4a1f7daabf95c0334dad3c2", "ja": "亜美も昴さんも、表に出たのは怒りの感情だったけど。\n裏側にあったのは、たぶん……不安、だと思う。", "zh": "亚美和昴小姐表现出来的虽然是愤怒的情绪，但隐藏在背后的，大概是……不安吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "efc6149181759bbfc5b645518846f9c92a291f95725af67579eaba31438dd6b0", "ja": "不安……？", "zh": "不安……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "b39ad92a216efcca68055d2b4c358caed5ec7207e99353d1eaf33ad5046fd9d7", "ja": "そう。相手は自分を好きだっていう……信用というか。\nそういう気持ちがあるからこそ、みたいな……。", "zh": "对。因为相信对方是喜欢自己的……该说是信任吧。\n正因为有这样的心情，才会……之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "fd75902e982758dba81bcee2d92e80d369e2c7ceeef5e08e77f4d26899b3bee9", "ja": "私も、うまく言えないんだけど……\nこれで伝わる？", "zh": "我也不太会表达……\n这样能传达给你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1025_011ami", "source_sha256": "91250f2efbcaf4fa95fc9ce020635e88a72ee27368540e359d53b1cf0ae143ec", "ja": "なるほどなるほど……わかったよ、しほりん！\nんっふっふ～♪", "zh": "原来如此原来如此……明白了哦，志保琳！\n嗯呼呼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "fa7e58ac93b951c780202cf3abdf19ddfb53ffba603ee4a748fb0693e92ff519", "ja": "亜美さん？\nもしかして、何か思いつかれたんですか？", "zh": "亚美？\n难道是想到什么好主意了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "8bee7ac4aa5f536449ac4dc5571f36ad3bdcd22c65bb3f7a6888f01c3fd353cb", "ja": "すっげー作戦とか！？", "zh": "什么超厉害的作战之类的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1028_011ami", "source_sha256": "f6af2704e59eb9cd3078fb9166b9a6b409334124b1f2cbfd9d9be8241b972ca8", "ja": "作戦なんかいらないのだよ、昴くん！\nだって亜美たち、そのまんまでいいんだから！", "zh": "根本不需要什么作战计划啦，昴！\n因为我们保持原样就可以了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1029_011ami", "source_sha256": "ff07a04f683d243591eedf10d91478ce08d7a27ab8a26816ad3866eeef05cd50", "ja": "この亜美から、まだ見たことのない表情を\n引き出すとは……やるね、兄ちゃん！", "zh": "居然能让这个亜美露出从未见过的表情……真有你的，哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1030_011ami", "source_sha256": "83558335883f503fda78e0c3ba08da111142a19ccd32ca217dc98f157f012cbf", "ja": "よ～し、みんな！　早速、レッスン開始だー！", "zh": "好～啦，大家！马上开始训练——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1031_null", "source_sha256": "c710de22af2d5a9636c0d1f4b65c3da75cb1bbc836b3f6ef923b9d5b8acddf22", "ja": "レッスン終了後……", "zh": "练习结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1032_047sub", "source_sha256": "70f6b77cf90c4e930eeb49793796bf8031674fc672168afddaa5b7280cc5b319", "ja": "特訓のおかげでコツも掴めたし、\n次はもっとうまく歌えそうだな～。……ん？", "zh": "多亏了特训，我也掌握诀窍了，\n下次应该能唱得更好吧～……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1033_null", "source_sha256": "23ec7c5b0cb81cfc93f6af806bcc016d918ab89810bc85a32fc877b51cdbcb8c", "ja": "うーん、確かにいつもよりは遅いけど……\nヒロ兄、メッセージは送ったんだろ？", "zh": "嗯，确实比平时慢，不过……  \nHiro哥，你已经发过消息了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0247_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0247_story_04_1034_null", "source_sha256": "65501cd901f23487aec3c383ba30e45520dd076eea1b4afef8e9911e4954b595", "ja": "それはそうなんだけど……！\nやっぱオレ、劇場まで車で迎えに行ってくる！", "zh": "话是这么说没错……！\n果然还是我开车去剧场接你吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
